Package: cue-media-engine
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @PYTHON_DEP@, python3-venv, ffmpeg, alsa-utils, adduser
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/L252-Media-Production/cue-media-engine
Description: playlist audio player for live AV work
 A playlist audio player for live AV work, controlled from Bitfocus Companion
 (OSC and HTTP) and from its own web page. One Python program, no build step.
 .
 Installs the systemd service cue-media-engine (user cueme, web page on port
 8080). The Python packages come from a bundled wheelhouse, so no internet
 connection is needed at install time.
